# RAW camera originals under public/ — blocking is DELIBERATELY DISABLED for now.
#
# Ava is still importing photo batches and commits raws straight into
# public/images/<...>/ from her laptop, so these rules would silently drop them.
# Leave them commented until the import is finished.
#
# THEN do the cleanup pass (agreed 2026-08-06):
#   1. uncomment the patterns below,
#   2. rewrite history to strip the raw blobs (they are ~1.2 GB of the repo and,
#      because this repo is public, stay readable forever otherwise — EXIF GPS
#      included). This needs a force-push and invalidates other clones.
#
# Raws must still be processed into web assets before release, and the processed
# files (<prefix>-01.jpg / <prefix>-video-01.mp4) never match these patterns:
#   node scripts/process-community-media.mjs <slug> <prefix> --from <raw dir>
#
# public/images/**/*.[Hh][Ee][Ii][Cc]
# public/images/**/*.[Hh][Ee][Ii][Ff]
# public/images/**/*.[Mm][Oo][Vv]
# public/images/**/*.[Tt][Ii][Ff]
# public/images/**/*.[Tt][Ii][Ff][Ff]
# public/images/**/IMG_*
# public/images/**/DSC_*
# public/images/**/DCIM*
# public/images/**/100_*

# Local-only verification harnesses (Playwright; needs `npm i --no-save playwright`)
verify-*.mjs
diag.mjs

# Personal research scratch (not part of the site)
whiskers.md
REV 12 Aero Notes.pdf

# Hackathon application drafts (personal, not part of the site)
hackmit.md
hackharvard.md

